direction: down
c0: "ConstructUsing(s => expression)\non the map?"
cu1: "One-parameter lambda with an expression body,\nnothing of the profile used?"
cu2: "Expression (s → source) is the creation;\nall members mapped after it"
q1: "Destination class has one public constructor\n(copy constructor excluded)?"
q2: "Several constructors: take the one with the most\nparameters AutoMapper can resolve (first declared on a tie)"
q2b: "Chosen constructor decidable\n(no flattening doubt, no private one,\nno ForMember on a parameter)?"
q3: "Per parameter: one readable source member\nwith the same name in any case,\nnot ref/out/params, no ForMember on it?"
q4: "MemberValues.Problem gives a value\n(copy, nested map, collection copy)?"
q5: "Remaining members (not filled by a parameter)\npass the member rules?"
new0: "new() { ... } (public parameterless wins)"
ok: "new(source.X, ...) { Y = ... }"
okcu: "new T(...) { Y = ... } or a block body\nvar destination = expression; destination.Y = ...;"
mcu: "Manual: ResolutionContext, block body,\nmethod group, profile member or captured parameter"
m1: "Manual: no public constructor, or none resolvable"
m1b: "Manual: choice not decided here"
m2: "Manual: parameter reason"
m3: "Manual: conversion / nested problem"
m4: "Manual: member reason"
c0 -> cu1: yes
c0 -> q1: no
cu1 -> mcu: no
cu1 -> cu2: yes
cu2 -> q5
q1 -> new0: "only a parameterless one"
q1 -> q2: "several"
q1 -> q3: "one with parameters"
q2 -> q2b
q2b -> m1b: no
q2b -> new0: "parameterless wins"
q2b -> q3: yes
q1 -> m1: none
q3 -> m2: no
q3 -> q4: yes
q4 -> m3: no
q4 -> q5: yes
q5 -> m4: no
q5 -> ok: "yes (constructor)"
q5 -> okcu: "yes (ConstructUsing)"
